#: badend4:badend4_D864E876_6908_4DFD_8C59_9960C551FBD0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 30d64130846927bf63333844b6b21355c6ceb0e5633aa40ca699e85fea94267e
#. default-sha256: 9233370ea314c8009f90e44f6219c413ce055349f31a54ae92eac4668339abdb
msgctxt "badend4:badend4_D864E876_6908_4DFD_8C59_9960C551FBD0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫I ⟪k:15⟫"
"wanted⟪k:16⟫ to deny it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫Eu ⟪k:15⟫"
"queria⟪k:16⟫ negar isso."

#: badend4:badend4_43C57723_0AE5_4E6A_91A1_50A7736B839E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06a88cc8786534259d5f7a719e0d620534bebc0172ff29f1b1240eee3d7d8bfc
#. default-sha256: 1fcae8dc1238aa612701e60d884b73bacdca420d69dc643341d7805be198ecf1
msgctxt "badend4:badend4_43C57723_0AE5_4E6A_91A1_50A7736B839E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She may have forgotten me, but what she felt still remains,⟪k:1⟫as evidenced by her "
"attraction to the White-Haired Girl—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫who had many physical similarities to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela pode ter me esquecido, mas o que ela sentiu ainda permanece,⟪k:1⟫como evidenciado por "
"sua atração pela Garota de Cabelos Brancos—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫que tinha muitas semelhanças físicas "
"comigo."

#: badend4:badend4_9C2EAC76_A8D9_419D_81C0_982690FB038E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a608bd023c236f10522d488c5699f09b4f9df00cf9a058a0f9a2f91ab03bb8b
#. default-sha256: d581fbc5e4c805aa8a4962b85589ebb708053b6c2da1ca7589ae2349d1abe495
msgctxt "badend4:badend4_9C2EAC76_A8D9_419D_81C0_982690FB038E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her feelings are still there. ⟪k:1⟫I sincerely believe that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Os sentimentos dela ainda estão lá. ⟪k:1⟫Eu sinceramente acredito nisso."

#: badend4:badend4_851B3478_1274_403C_8DEA_5A643985E0D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 41ec11d9c080aab32abe701b55cce4dbf6d80211af7b3342d354af1155ea3294
#. default-sha256: 10ab433ff96708748a62f168f9c7de7cd9a76b9ca1e4ea85776432f0a89b7a59
msgctxt "badend4:badend4_851B3478_1274_403C_8DEA_5A643985E0D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But her arctic gaze caused me to waver for the briefest moment. ⟪k:1⟫Perhaps I only wanted "
"to deny it for my own selfish reasons."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas seu olhar ártico me fez vacilar por um breve momento. ⟪k:1⟫Talvez eu só quisesse negar "
"por minhas próprias razões egoístas."

#: badend4:badend4_2D2BD374_E3CE_430E_A7A5_A76BBE55101A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e94ebddbfc0a15036edf56a7791637c74eb1fc3c36c7ecd9c5ea495d0c9d35ff
