msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Adeus, Michel."

#: badend4:badend4_DEDD2D2D_E3D0_4446_8DB8_75FE39F1FEEE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a86731957486e983e8ce37a071bb8b5a89a489263fa194f22d82b2b6805d4bf2
