#: badend4:badend4_016BD7A2_04E1_497B_A66B_E34C427F0DAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 978d9a03c584e8860438dc2a9cd1d5f301da9f880dd6f92a9edec0f1692ce680
